      "title": "I\u2019m a Narcissist and This Is EXACTLY What Spiritual Manipulation Looks Like!",
      "description": "I\u2019m Lee Hammock, a diagnosed narcissist, and in this reaction I break down a Life Works Church announcement in which Pastor Lydia introduces Minister Shakayla as her husband Prophet Israel\u2019s second wife. The pastor says the second marriage is approaching three years, while the announcement describes their relationship as \u201Cthe will of God.\u201D \n\nI share my perspective on spiritual manipulation, religious authority, accountability, and the congregation\u2019s response. This conversation is about how faith can be used to justify behavior, not an attack on religion or a clinical diagnosis of anyone featured. Subscribe to Mental Healness and share your thoughts: what stood out most about this announcement?\n\n\nAll My Links (Coaching, Courses, Merch): https://link.me/mentalhealness\n\nRESOURCES \u0026 SUPPORT: \n\uD83D\uDCD5 Free Healing From Betrayal Guide - https://betrayal-reset.subscribepage.io/\n\uD83D\uDCDA Self Love Journal: https://a.co/d/70L3zKb \n\uD83D\uDCD6 Kid\u2019s Book (\u0022It\u0027s Not Your Fault\u0022): https://a.co/d/2WNtdKJ \n\uD83C\uDFA5 Podcast: https://youtube.com/@mentalhealnesspodcast?si=AVcJfHa16HZReqHL\n\nWHO IS LEE HAMMOCK? I am a diagnosed narcissist who has spent over 9 years in psychotherapy to understand my own mind and help you protect yours. On this channel, I take the mask off to show you how narcissists think, why we do what we do, and how you can heal from the damage.\n\nJoin the Community: www.youtube.com/channel/UCm1vYQOEQRo6X4Dy8KoGPMw/join \nWant to be a Guest? https://tinyurl.com/Mental-Healness-Podcast-Form",
